                                "sense_id": "a584262b-6648-3fb3-a9b8-8bdfad5ff360",
                                "text": "More than once had he caught me in the act and given me, as he put it, “a good warming,” with his hard hand so, however much I was tempted so to do, I steadfastly refrained."
